<title>PHILIPPINES: PH-ADR Philippine stocks traded abroad.</title>
<headline>PH-ADR Philippine stocks traded abroad.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. equities and financial markets were closed on Friday due to the Independence Day holiday. Closing prices of Philippine stocks traded on Wall Street on Thursday:</p>
<p>Company   Close	 Net Change  High     Low	 Volume</p>
<p>PLDT     $33 1/2	+0 7/8	33 1/2   32 3/4     183400</p>
<p>Benguet  $0*11	    -	   0*11     0/05	 6100</p>
<p>1st Phil $12/15	 +0/03	 13/03   12/13	 56700</p>
</text>
